.TH start-cli-package-start 1  "start "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-package\-start \- Start a service
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli package start\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start a service
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Request startup when blocking critical tasks clear
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Package identifier
